WEBVTT

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:54.170
Luck is always essential for tests!

00:01:56.380 --> 00:02:01.430
Yeah, we barely passed because of luck.

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:02.850
Really?

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:05.140
It's just like the level 9 exam.

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:07.840
You'll definitely pass if ya take it again.

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:11.190
And you can be like Onpu-chan, skipping levels.

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:13.270
Oh yeah!

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:15.320
That's true.

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:18.290
I'm actually pretty good, right?

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:19.520
Skipping tests, eh?

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:21.770
I just have to try my best.

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:23.370
Yeah, yeah, that's right.

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:24.170
That's right.

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:28.750
Onpu-chan.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.280
The level 3 exam was easy for me,

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:34.210
but the people who failed it will still fail next time.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:39.760
Onpu-chan, don't say things like that!

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:42.760
Doremi-chan finally cheered up!

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.460
Ah, I'm sorry!

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:48.230
I'm very straightforward, so I say what I mean.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.720
Doremi-chan, fight on!

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.940
What an insensitive person.

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:03.460
Father and Son - The Move Towards Victory!

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.660
Thanks for the meal!

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:16.570
The class representative for today!

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:18.590
Here!

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:22.550
Can you come to the office to pick up some handouts before the afternoon class?

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:23.990
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:26.470
I just had to be the representative today.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:29.330
I really am the world's unluckiest pretty girl.

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:31.640
Doremi-chan, do you want me to get them for you?

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.270
Don't worry, I'll go myself.

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:36.260
Hey!

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:38.130
Who's the male representative today?

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:41.390
U-Um... I'm right here.

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:44.740
Ah, Taniyama-kun.

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:48.490
Taniyama-kun, you're like some kind of ghost that comes out when the sun's out.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:53.670
A ghost is scary at night, but in the morning, you can't really see it.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.380
What do you mean?

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.340
I'm saying that people easily forget that you even exist.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:00.840
Don't say it like that!

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.400
I'm kidding!

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.600
Don't be so sad!

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:08.050
I'm the one that should be sad.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.770
Harukaze-san, you're feeling like a failure too?

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:13.230
What do you mean by <i>that</i> ?

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:16.170
Um... Nothing... Sorry.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.610
Eh? Where's Seki-sensei?

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:30.080
Oh, she's playing shogi.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.070
Seki-sensei, where are the handouts?

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:36.340
On top of that table.

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:37.620
Let's go, Taniyama-kun.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:38.710
Wait a second.

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:45.180
As a woman, you're ten years too early to be challenging a pro like me.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:54.600
Teacher, you're about to win.

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:57.090
Move the Gold General to 2-7.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:04:59.530
B-But...

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:01.030
Don't worry. Move it.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:02.960
Really?

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:10.280
That's useless. Why did you say Seki-sensei will win?

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.030
Move the Knight to 1-5.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:15.610
Am I going to lose?

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:17.290
Move the Silver General to 2-3.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:19.670
J-J-Jeweled King to 1-2!

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.130
The Silver General promotes while taking the Knight.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.880
I-I'll retreat!

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:27.280
Knight to 2-5, right?

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:27.800
Yes.

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:31.810
How's that, vice principal?

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:34.710
I-I lost.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:36.800
I won!

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:39.320
Taniyama, that was nice advice!

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:43.230
Ehhh? I don't really understand shogi, but that was great, Taniyama-kun.

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:47.000
I-I just got careless and lost that time.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.360
You! You look like you know a bit about shogi.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:49.950
Play a match with me.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.250
Me?

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:58.570
Lunch recess is over.

00:05:58.570 --> 00:06:00.840
Well then, vice principal, I'll leave the rest to you.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.260
Harukaze, Taniyama, let's go.

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:07.260
Wa-... Um...

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.340
I can't believe it!

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:12.510
Majo Rika, stop drinking!

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.110
Shaddup.

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:16.640
Jeez!

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:24.930
It's fine if Hadzuki or Aiko fails, since I'd still have a chance to return to normal.

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:26.980
But that stupid Doremi failed again!

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:29.990
How can I not drink because of that!?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:34.410
Plush-chan, stop that!

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:35.780
Pop?

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:38.270
Doremi was wrong in failing...

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:41.130
But that's all in the past now, so stop complaining.

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:44.630
I'll work hard in Doremi's place!

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.710
Pop!

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:52.130
You're such a good child!

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:55.710
You smell like alcohol!

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:59.270
And your face is so red, not cute at all!

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:02.690
Taniyama-kun, I heard you're really good at shogi!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.510
That's not true.

00:07:04.510 --> 00:07:06.900
Don't be so modest, be more proud!

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:09.770
Didn't ya beat the vice principal who was a first dan?

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:11.330
That's amazing!

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:14.870
Ya could become a pro in the future, just like that Sakada Sankichi guy!

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.740
Thank you very much!

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:18.830
That ain't Sakada, ya idiot.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:23.920
I'm talkin' about that famous shogi master from that song!

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.370
Hadzuki-chan, do you know about him?

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:26.200
Nope.

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:27.550
You Kanto people are all...

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:33.260
Come on! If yer from Osaka, ya hafta know someone as famous as him!

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:38.350
Then Taniyama-kun, you could be a famous shogi master in the future, right?

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.230
I-I don't really like shogi.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:42.950
I don't want to become a pro!

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:44.460
See ya!

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:45.690
Taniyama-kun!

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.980
He was lying about hating shogi, right?

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:51.900
When we were at the office, he was really into it!

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:59.930
Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan, I'll leave the Maho-dou to you two.

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:02.620
I want to talk to Taniyama-kun a bit more.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:03.710
Doremi-chan!?

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:07.170
She's gettin' into other people's business again.

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:10.180
Oh well, that's her good point at least.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:11.720
Yeah.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:16.640
Shogi Dojo

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:19.100
Misora City Junior Shogi Tournament
Now taking entrants!

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:24.580
Oh! Nice move, Shota.

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.730
Nice job, thinking up that move.

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:30.610
Like father, like son, huh?

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:38.630
So here you are, Taniyama-kun.

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:40.910
Harukaze-san.

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:43.410
So you <i>do </i> love shogi.

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:46.880
Jeez, mind your own business!

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:53.300
Stop following me!

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:55.260
Now you're making me even more curious!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.720
Please, leave me alone!

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:59.770
Then tell me why you don't like shogi.

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:02.340
It has nothing to do with you, Harukaze-san.

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:03.680
You love shogi, right!?

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:15.070
Harukaze-san!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.650
That feels so good.

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:26.000
Thank you, Taniyama-kun, I'm so clumsy.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.110
I even think that myself.

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:34.010
But you made me realize that I was lying to myself.

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:37.190
I actually love shogi.

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:39.430
Then why did you say that you didn't like it?

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:45.180
Actually my father almost became a pro, but it didn't happen.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:57.200
In order to become a pro, you have to join the Japan Shogi Association.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:00.750
You work your way up slowly from level 6.

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.700
You have to get to level 4 before you can become a pro.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:04.580
Just like the apprentice exams.

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:05.620
Apprentice exams?

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:09.270
I-It's nothing, just talking to myself.

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:13.050
Anyway, Taniyama-kun, why was your father unable to become a pro?

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:16.640
Well, if you don't get to level 4 before your 30th birthday,

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:19.260
you have to leave the Shogi Association.

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:21.430
That's pretty strict.

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:23.740
Dad!!

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:27.730
From this day forward, I am finished with shogi! I refuse to play ever again!

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:31.900
My father spent entire days drinking after that and got into fights with my mother.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:32.920
Why you!

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:34.650
My father spent entire days drinking after that and got into fights with my mother.

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:39.860
That's why my mother hates shogi and told me never to play.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:42.250
Isn't that a shame, though!?

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:45.150
I can tell that you have talent at shogi!

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:47.080
I'm so jealous!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.040
Harukaze-san...

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:53.690
I played a bit of piano before elementary school.

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:57.270
My dream was to become the world's best and most beautiful pianist.

00:10:57.270 --> 00:10:58.760
But I didn't have any talent.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:05.720
But if I had that talent, I would have loved piano even more and kept playing!

00:11:06.780 --> 00:11:10.870
I'm no good, but you have talent!

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:14.890
Even if your parents are against it, if you love playing, go for it!

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:16.690
I also think so.

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:43.140
I heard your story.

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:48.720
Taniyama, if you really love playing, then play.

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:54.480
I want to play, but my mom would be sad and my dad wouldn't like it.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:55.970
Like I said,

00:11:55.970 --> 00:11:57.440
I'll talk to them about it.

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.030
Teacher.

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:01.050
Let's do that, Taniyama-kun.

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.450
They might let you enter the shogi tournament.

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.120
Okay!

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:07.890
Then you've decided.

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:09.080
Let's go right now.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:16.630
Even if his teacher asks me to, I will never let Shota play shogi.

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:23.550
I understand your feelings, but as his mother, can you really take away his talent and dreams just like that?

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:24.930
Go home.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:26.430
But!

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:31.960
The shogi that normal people play and the shogi that pros play are completely different!

00:12:32.490 --> 00:12:35.680
I don't want Shota to be hurt like I was!

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:37.230
Please mind your own business.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:38.520
But!

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:40.540
Teacher, it's fine already.

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:42.190
I'll stop playing shogi...

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:43.980
You can't give up like this!

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:45.780
Taniyama-kun's father!

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:51.100
Taniyama-kun hasn't played shogi for three years, but he beat our vice principal, a first dan!

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:52.620
He has amazing talent!

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:57.540
He has more than talent. He always works very hard.

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:02.960
Taniyama, you haven't been playing, but you've been studying, right?

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:04.260
Yes.

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:12.100
I go to the shogi dojo every day to see the old men play.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:14.310
I also collect news about shogi.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:19.550
Taniyama really loves the shogi that you taught him.

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:23.920
Please allow Taniyama to play. Please!

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:25.570
Father! Mother!

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:28.540
I really love shogi.

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:30.330
Please let me play!

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:36.950
Shota, do you really want to play that badly?

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:38.180
Yes.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:41.640
Please let me play! Please!

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:42.770
Dear...

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:43.630
I understand.

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:47.340
But only if you win at that tournament.

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.010
Father!

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:50.300
Yes!

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:53.140
Thank you, Harukaze-san, Seki-sensei.

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.600
Taniyama, that's great!

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.560
I'll try my best!

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.660
Shogi Dojo

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:01.520
Hadzuki-chan, hurry up!

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:10.610
How's he doin', Doremi-chan?

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:11.950
He's doing amazing!

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:15.410
He's won so many matches and now he's in the semifinals.

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:19.040
That's so great! His talent is the real deal!

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:22.080
Well, how is he doin' in this match?

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:25.260
Teacher, has he won yet?

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:27.280
Look over there.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:32.450
Taniyama-kun's father came too!

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:36.930
I have no moves left.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.060
I have lost.

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:46.440
Father...

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:47.820
Yes!

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:53.240
He can continue playing if he wins one more!

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:55.490
But the next match is tough.

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:59.910
I heard from Taniyama that the next guy is a regular at this dojo.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:02.470
And he's a sixth grader who is a third dan.

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:03.460
Third dan...

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.500
Don't worry, don't worry.

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.420
Taniyama-kun will definitely win!

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:11.280
I don't really get it, but ya seem really into this, Doremi-chan.

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:13.390
Ahhh, maybe ya like Taniyama-kun...

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:16.220
N-No! That's not it!

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:21.400
I was feeling pretty down, but I felt much better after cheering for him.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:24.290
Ah, there's Doremi-chan's signature smile!

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:25.140
Yer right!

00:15:25.140 --> 00:15:27.180
Alright, let's cheer fer him together!

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:27.570
Yeah!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.860
The finals will be held in a special room.

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:35.150
The game will be shown on the TV and on this board.

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:37.580
Please come this way if you are an audience member.

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:48.270
The finals seem so formal.

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:49.720
It's like a pro game.

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:52.590
You will lose!

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:55.720
What was that voice just now?

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:58.100
Taniyama-kun looks so nervous.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:00.630
It's the finals, of course he'll be nervous.

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:02.740
Taniyama-kun, fight!

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:05.110
I'm sorry.

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:08.660
My father is watching me play.

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.030
I have to do my best.

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:14.530
Well then, the finals of the Misora City Junior Shogi Tournament shall now begin.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:20.500
Once you have used up your 20 minutes, you will have 60 seconds to make each move.

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.830
First player, pawn 7-6.

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.770
Second player, pawn 8-4.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.340
First player, pawn 2-6.

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.030
Second player, pawn 8-5.

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:33.380
First player, silver general 7-8.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.370
Second player, silver general 3-2.

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:41.130
Second player, bishop 8-8.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.210
First player, the same, gold general.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.940
You aren't going to watch?

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:01.500
Ma'am, Shota is going to win.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:05.090
All this time, he has progressed so much.

00:17:05.090 --> 00:17:07.230
But it's still only the start of the match.

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:08.170
Don't worry.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:12.920
That promoted bishop follows the Yagura tactic that I taught him.

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:15.380
Oh, I see.

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:21.100
I have lost.

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.870
How's Taniyama's situation?

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:32.280
He was doin' pretty well, but...

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:36.200
Why doesn't he move that bishop into enemy territory?

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:39.410
It will put him at a great advantage.

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:46.140
Um, I need to go to the restroom.

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:49.240
Your time will keep going, so please hurry.

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:49.880
Okay.

00:17:58.530 --> 00:17:59.170
Here.

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:01.500
Harukaze-san, thank you.

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:03.740
Taniyama-kun, what's wrong?

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:04.890
Something seems wrong.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:09.350
Yer father said that ya hafta move that bishop into enemy territory.

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:11.530
I think that's the right move too...

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:16.050
But when I picked up the piece, I could see an image of me losing.

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:18.320
This is the first time that this has happened.

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:22.990
Ah, I'm sorry, my time is almost up.

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:24.040
Thank you.

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:26.690
Doremi-chan, maybe this is...

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:29.000
The work of a Bad Item?

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:32.210
I'll get Oyajiide right now!

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:48.770
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:15.210
There's no mistaking it! That piece is a Bad Item!

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:17.270
Thank you, Oyajiide.

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:22.640
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:26.240
Time, stop!

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:34.860
Now then, let's go.

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:37.950
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:44.410
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:50.290
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:02.170
Magical Stage!

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:10.350
Come out, Bad Card!

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:29.120
Alright!

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.080
Okay!

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.740
Taniyama-kun, do your best!

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:46.800
My bishop...

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:52.030
Nothing happened.

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:52.730
Okay...

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.070
He won.

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:02.010
I...

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:03.570
I have lost.

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:05.240
Yes!

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:11.310
Taniyama-kun, congratulations.

00:21:11.310 --> 00:21:12.410
That's great!

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:13.910
Yer really good!

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:15.190
Thank you.

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:17.140
I won because of your support.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:24.140
Father, I won.

00:21:24.140 --> 00:21:25.630
I can play shogi now, right?

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:29.100
I'm surprised you won with such horrible shogi.

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:32.560
Sir, stop being shy. Just tell him properly.

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:34.520
Ohh! I-I'm sorry.

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.110
Shota, from this point forward, I will no longer drink.

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:42.220
In place of that, I shall drill you in shogi like before.

00:21:42.220 --> 00:21:43.240
Be prepared!

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:45.960
Father...

00:21:47.940 --> 00:21:48.910
Father!

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:03.870
Eh? A fight?

00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:09.020
Yes, Onpu-chan's autograph for Amano-kun was stolen by an upperclassman!

00:22:09.020 --> 00:22:12.100
That's our hero lover, Amano-kun. He has a strong sense of justice.

00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:14.150
But a fight won't solve things!

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:16.060
Okay, it's time for the heroes to appear!

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:16.680
Eh?

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:18.900
Ojamajo Sentai - Majo Rangers!

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:19.950
Wait, Doremi-chan.

00:22:19.950 --> 00:22:22.680
I'm not Doremi, I'm Majo Pink!

00:22:22.680 --> 00:22:24.000
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:25.760
Ojamajos - Battle for Justice!?

00:22:25.760 --> 00:22:28.470
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
